WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Crouching medium punch whiffs as Ken recovers from the prerequisite corner Uppercut.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.250
Crouching light kick reaches Ken on wake-up.

3
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:01.800
Crouching jabs continue the low confirm.

4
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:02.650
Regular light Flash Knuckle launches at the corner.

5
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.350
Light Rising Uppercut follows the Knuckle juggle.
